## QUESTION : KAUNSA LB USE KARNA HAI ?
-----------------------------------------

Since ye monolithic architecture hai — sirf ek hi service ke multiple
instances hain. URL routing application ke andar hoti hai (Spring Boot
controllers me), LB ke paas nahi.

Isliye technically L4 kaafi hai — bas traffic distribute karna hai.

Lekin production me generally L7 prefer karte hain:

    - SSL Termination    → Centralized certificate management

    - App-level health checks  → /health endpoint hit karke actual
                                  application health check karta hai.
                                  L4 sirf TCP-level check kar sakta hai
                                  (port open hai ya nahi) — usse pata
                                  nahi chalta ki application andar se
                                  hang hai ya healthy.

    - Future-proofing    → Kal microservices me convert ho, to L7
                            already URL routing support karta hai



