## QUESTION : KAUNSA LB USE KARNA HAI ?
-----------------------------------------

### LB in front of API Gateways
---------------------------------

API Gateway ke saamne L4 LB hi kaafi hai, kyunki:

    - URL routing API Gateway khud karta hai
    - LB ka kaam sirf API Gateway instances ke beech traffic
      distribute karna hai
    - L4 LB sirf TCP-level check karta hai (port open hai ya nahi).
      Agar API Gateway andar se hang hai lekin port open hai, to L4
      usse healthy maan lega — ye problem detect nahi hogi.
    - Isliye modern L4 LB (jaise AWS NLB) HTTP health checks bhi
      support karta hai


### Service LBs
------------------

Technically L4 kaafi hai, kyunki API Gateway ne routing already
kar di hoti hai — Service LB ko bas us service ke instances
ke beech traffic distribute karna hai.

Lekin production me generally L7 prefer karte hain — proper
health checks aur observability ke liye.



