## NOTE : YAHAN L7 LB MANDATORY HAI
-------------------------------------

Yah dedicated API Gateway nahi hai. L7 LB hi API
Gateway ka role perform kar raha hai — URL routing, SSL Termination,
app-level health checks.

Isliye yahan L4 kaafi nahi hoga — L7 mandatory hai.





